        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 32 Malahide Road to the Dublin 3 property market. \r\n\r\nThis well-proportioned three-bedroom home offers generous accommodation and excellent potential, all set in a highly convenient and well-established location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading into a bright and spacious living room overlooking the front of the property. To the rear is the kitchen, which benefits from direct access to the exceptionally large rear garden and seamlessly connects to the dining room. A bathroom completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with en-suite.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from a private driveway with off-street parking, accessed directly from the Malahide Road. The property also enjoys a private south-east-facing rear garden, along with rear laneway access from Victoria Villas.\r\n\r\nSituated on the Malahide Road, No. 32 enjoys excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and the surrounding suburbs. The property is conveniently positioned close to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities. There are excellent public transport links serving the area, including regular bus services and nearby Clontarf DART station. The M50 and Dublin Airport are also readily accessible, while the location provides easy access to a number of popular north and south coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nWith its generous accommodation, exceptionally large rear garden, off-street parking, rear laneway access and excellent transport links, 32 Malahide Road offers an attractive opportunity for a wide range of buyers, including owner-occupiers and investors.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
